[[File:CatDic.png|thumb|right|100px]] The '''Cat Guide''' is a compendium of [[Cat Units]] the player has obtained. It is unlocked after clearing [[Madagascar (Empire of Cats)|Madagascar/Tottori]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. In The Battle Cats Unite!, it is unlocked by clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]] in the Empire of Cats Chapter.

==Overview==
*The Cat Guide is grouped into several pages, chiefly sorted by rarity. Each page contains up to four rows of six units represented by their Normal Forms' icons, for a maximum of 24 units per page. Units that have not been unlocked are represented by a gray question mark icon. The Cat Guide has a filter like the [[Upgrade Menu]] and Equip Menu, but with the additional option to exclude "Limited" units from irregular events such as collabs.
*Tapping on a unit's icon will bring the player to its Cat Guide entry. From there they can view its unlocked forms, name, description, targeted traits and abilities.
*An arrow button in the bottom-right corner hides the currently displayed cat's description and moves the unit to the bottom of the screen, which is necessary to fully view bigger characters such as [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Unknown Cat]].
*The player can tap on a cat to knock it back. After landing on the ground, they will move back to the center at their normal speed.
*When the player views the entry of a unit or form they haven't unlocked yet, it will be displayed as a bouncing white question mark named "???" with a hint on how to unlock it. Units that are meant to be surprises, such as [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]] and [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]], have "???" as their hints.
*Newly unlocked units will have the text "New!" on their icons; viewing the entries of such units for the first time will award the player 5 [[Cat Food]].
*Pressing the "Select" button allows the player to mark units as favorites. Once in the Upgrade or Equip Menu, they can then filter to only display favorites.
*During the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]], [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Goggles Cat]] can be unlocked by tapping its recruit button that appears in the Cat Guide.

==Order==
In addition to rarity, units in the Cat Guide are further sorted into groups based on how they are unlocked or which part of the game they are from. For example, the [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]' section starts with [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] units such as [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Pogo Cat]], which is then followed by [[:Category:Monthly Events|monthly event]] drops, then seasonal drops, and so on.
*[[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]]: Purchasable units, [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]], [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]], [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Crazed Moneko]], [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]], [[Capsule Cat (Special Cat)|Capsule Cat]], [[Cat Bros (Special Cat)]], [[Squish Ball Cat (Special Cat)|Squish Ball Cat]], [[Maneki Cat (Special Cat)|Maneki Cat]], anniversary units ([[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|Coin Cat]], [[Farmer Cat (Special Cat)|Farmer Cat]], etc.) and seasonal [[:Category:Event Capsule Cats|Event Capsule Cats]], [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], collab units, [[:Category:Li'l Cats|Li'l Cats]], [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] ([[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] first, then the main [[Legend Stages]], then [[Heavenly Tower]])
*[[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]: Standard [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] units, [[:Category:Monthly Events|monthly event]] drops, seasonal event drops, [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone]]/[[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent]] drops, Rare [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], collab units
*[[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]]: Standard Rare Cat Capsule units, [[Rare Capsule Bonus Characters]] (all [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Nenekos]] are grouped together), [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]], Cyclone/Advent drops, [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], collab units
*[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]]: [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]], [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Vajiras]], [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Galaxy Gals]], [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|DRAGON EMPERORS]], [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]], [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Dark Heroes]], [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Majestic Zeus]], [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]], [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|ELEMENTAL PIXIES]], collab units, [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Nekolugas]], [[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie]], [[Li'l Valkyrie Dark (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie Dark]], Busters/[[Dynasty Fest (Gacha Event)|Dynasty Fest]]/[[RoyalFest (Gacha Event)|RoyalFest]] exclusives, [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] exclusives (seasonal and [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] units are grouped with their original variants)

