==Trivia==
*The background is actually animated. If you pay attention to the grid background you will notice that the it will fade into a solid blue and then eventually will fade back into a grid pattern.
*There is a typo stating that [[Salaryman Cat (Rare Cat)|Salaryman Cat]] is unlocked from "Loving Labor" instead of [[Loving Labour (Monthly Event)|Loving Labour]].
*There are typos on each [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] uber, stating that they are obtained from "UBER FEST". [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] units do not have equivalent typos.
*[[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Puppetmaster & Charley]]'s unlock hint originally said "Eldritch Winds", a nonexistent stage, instead of [[Wrath of the Divine]].
*In [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], the hints for the Evolved Forms of [[Easter Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Easter Neneko]], [[Springtime Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Springtime Kenshin]] and [[Bunny & Canard (Uber Rare Cat)|Bunny & Canard]] were originally displayed in Japanese.
*The [[Cat Bros (Rare Cat)|Cat Bros]] became available to international version users sometime after [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]], but their entry in the Cat Guide was only added in in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

